<title>CANADA: MacMillan to sell American Cemwood unit. [CORRECTED 23:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>MacMillan to sell American Cemwood unit. [CORRECTED 23:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects spelling throughout to Cemwood from Semwood)</p>
<p>Forest products giant MacMillan Bloedel Ltd. said Wednesday it plans to sell American Cemwood, an unprofitable subsidiary in Oregon that makes cement fiber roofing material.</p>
<p>&quot;We recently sold our shipping business and have made plans to sell American Cemwood ...,&quot; Chief Executive Robert Findlay told the annual stockholders meeting.</p>
